{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>And it shall be at the harvest.</b> That they are his." "<b>And you shall give a fifth to Pharaoh.</b> For this is what is due to him from them, after he has paid what is incumbent upon him to pay." "<b>And four parts shall be yours for seed of the field.</b> Which he is obligated to give you, as the owner of the field." "<b>And for your food.</b> And for your provisions, which he is obligated to give you. Accordingly, the fifth remains his by right."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:34:58.779998206Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}